@startuml
title MES — Sequence: чтение списка заказов и запись об изменении статуса заказа

actor Operator as Op
participant "MES UI (React)" as UI
participant "MES API (.NET)" as API
participant "Redis Cache" as Cache
queue "RabbitMQ" as MQ
participant "Cache Updater" as Updater
database "MES DB (PostgreSQL)" as DB

== чтение списка заказов ==
Op -> UI: Open dashboard (status=NEW, page=1)
UI -> API: GET /orders?status=NEW&page=1&pageSize={Page_Size}
activate API
API -> Cache: GET orders:NEW:p1:{Page_Size}
alt Cache HIT
  Cache --> API: PageDTO[] (Age<=5s)
  API --> UI: 200 OK + data\n(Cache-Control: max-age=5, stale-while-revalidate=30)
  deactivate API
else Cache MISS
  Cache --> API: nil
  API -> API: Single-flight lock sf:orders:NEW:p1:{Page_Size} (5s)
  API -> DB: SELECT ... WHERE status=NEW ORDER BY updated_at DESC LIMIT {Page_Size}
  DB --> API: rows
  API -> Cache: SET orders:NEW:p1:{Page_Size} (TTL=5s)\nZADD z:orders:NEW updated_at order_id
  API --> UI: 200 OK + data
  deactivate API
end
note over API,Cache
Cache-Aside: TTL 5–10s
end note

== запись об изменении статуса заказа ==
Op -> UI: Click "Взять в обработку" (order_id=123)\nfrom NEW -> MANUFACTURING_STARTED
UI -> API: POST /orders/123/claim
activate API
API -> Cache: Acquire lock lock:order:123 (5s)
API -> DB: UPDATE orders SET status=MANUFACTURING_STARTED\nWHERE id=123 AND status=NEW
DB --> API: OK
API -> MQ: Publish OrderStatusChanged{123, NEW->MANUFACTURING_STARTED, ts}
API -> Cache: ZREM z:orders:NEW 123\nZADD z:orders:MANUFACTURING_STARTED ts 123
API --> UI: 200 OK
deactivate API

@enduml